104	      // invoking a freshly-deployed Cloudflare binding, so it is ridden out
105	      // HERE — the one adapter every binding flows through — rather than in any
106	      // single higher-level wrapper (`toHttpClient`, the client/server
107	      // overloads, the RPC DO transport all go through this). `Effect.promise`
