   313	| 3 | Adopt Common Practice's client ownership in `apps/web`; preserve RPC lifetime and trusted identity. Add named checked HTTP operations under `packages/api/http/src/client`, retaining public adapters. |
   314	| 4 | Move Cloudflare header interpretation from `packages/api/rpc/src/rate-identity.boundary.ts` into the API/Website host ingress. Keep the checked host-neutral identity contract. |
   315	| 5 | Move the executable lint asset out of copied skill folders into `tools/oxlint`; use the refreshed published plugin. Adapt manifest-aware import rules for nested package roots. |
   316	| 6 | Fix Bun's shared service lifetime at application composition, preserving its HTTP API and the host-independent packages. |
   317	| Later | Add safe operational records through the existing native Axiom/Cloudflare declarations. Keep unsafe native channels off; Cloudflare's native metrics are distinct from exported logs/traces. |
   318	
   319	No new generic utilities, second docs renderer, duplicated service facade or
   320	permanent audit system is needed. Preserve tax rules/facts, encoded public
   321	errors and HTTP statuses, RPC revision, MCP sessions, package names/subpaths and
   322	SDK behaviour. Breaking these contracts is outside this foundation change.
   323	
   324	## Source and documentation notes
   325	
   326	Matching upstream clones: Effect tag `effect@4.0.2`, commit
   327	`269a7c864351231d42e6e95b7fa8f32050df3691`; Alchemy tag `v2.0.0-beta.81`, commit
   328	`e73c66857553a5abe045e1a66b5512cf7d39ef2e`. Consulted owners include Effect
   329	`packages/effect/src/http/HttpRouter.ts`, `http-api/HttpApiBuilder.ts`,
   330	`packages/platform/bun/src/BunHttpServer.ts`; Alchemy `Plan.ts`,
   331	`Cloudflare/Workers/WorkerProvider.ts`, `WorkerBridge.ts`, `Cloudflare/Bridge.ts`
   332	and native Worker/Ruleset resources. Their supported patterns inform this
   333	proposal; local tests and deployed behaviour are separate observations.
   334	
   335	Documentation impact: **Change required** for the proposal, plan, decision
   336	priority and index pointers in this design edit; for root instructions,
   337	deployment/API/frontend/testing owners, commands/runbooks and local skill
   338	profiles during implementation. **Preserve** tax, API/SDK and package contracts,
   339	working public docs generation, and the agreed privacy/dataset choices.
   340	**N/A** for generated OpenAPI, package changelogs and provider records in this
   341	edit because none of those inputs or systems changed. The normal Git diff
   342	records this document change; it needs no additional impact JSON or digest.
"}}}

